<p>
A woman asked Jesus<br>
to heal her daughter,<br>
and Jesus said nothing.
</p>

<p>
Pilate asked Jesus<br>
to defend himself,<br>
and Jesus said nothing.
</p>

<p>
Yet the girl was healed,<br>
and Jesus went to the cross.
</p>

<p>
Forgive me, Lord,<br>
for the sin of<br>
saying everything but<br>
doing nothing.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


